SOLUTION 1
    units mol/kgw
    temp 25.0
    pH 7.0
    Ca 0.001
    C 0.002
    S 0.003
    water 1.0
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Gypsum 0.0 0.0
KINETICS 1
    Calcite
    -m 0.01
